  "scriptTeachers11": "Baada ya muda mfupi nitahesabu kutoka kumi hadi moja. Kwa kila namba, unaweza kuzama mara mbili zaidi ndani ya utulivu… na huhitaji kujitahidi. Sikiliza tu.",
  "scriptTeachers12": "Kumi… ukiachilia.",
  "scriptTeachers13": "Tisa… taratibu zaidi sasa.",
  "scriptTeachers14": "Nane… kelele za siku zikizidi kwenda mbali.",
  "scriptTeachers15": "Saba…",
  "scriptTeachers16": "Sita… ndani zaidi na tulivu zaidi.",
  "scriptTeachers17": "Tano… nusu ya njia, na kwa starehe.",
  "scriptTeachers18": "Nne…",
  "scriptTeachers19": "Tatu… kila pumzi ikikupeleka chini zaidi.",
  "scriptTeachers20": "Mbili… karibu kufika.",
  "scriptTeachers21": "Na moja.",
  "scriptTeachers22": "Ukipumzika hapa. Kimya. Salama.",
  "scriptTeachers23": "Sasa hebu tupite polepole katika mwili wako… na tuache mvutano ulegee, popote unapojificha.",
  "scriptTeachers24": "Elekeza umakini wako kwenye koo lako. Liache lilegee na kufunguka. Meza mate kwa upole.",
  "scriptTeachers25": "Sasa taya na ulimi wako. Acha ulimi upumzike kwa ulaini mdomoni. Acha taya liwe legevu.",
  "scriptTeachers26": "Chukua muda kutafuta kwa upole chochote ambacho bado kinashikilia… paji lililokunjamana, mkono uliokazwa, pumzi iliyozuiliwa. Popote utakapokipata, vuta pumzi… na unapotoa pumzi, kiache kiyeyuke.",
  "scriptTeachers27": "Shuka kupitia nyonga… miguu… hadi nyayo sakafuni. Umetulia ardhini. Umeegemezwa. Hakuna cha kushikilia sasa hivi.",
  "scriptTeachers28": "Mwili wako wote… tulivu na mzito na salama. Furahia hisia hii kwa pumzi chache za kimya.",
  "scriptTeachers29": "Wazia sauti yako kama wimbi tulivu likibingirika kuelekea ufukweni.",
  "scriptTeachers30": "Halihitaji kuwa na kelele. Linafika tu, wazi na thabiti, na kufikia mchanga. Kila mtu ufukweni anaweza kulisikia.",
  "scriptTeachers31": "Na unapopumzika hapa, acha maneno haya yatulie mahali fulani ndani kabisa, ambapo yanaweza kukufanyia kazi kimya kimya:",
  "scriptTeachers32": "Maswali yako yanastahili nafasi. Kuuliza ni nguvu.",
  "scriptTeachers33": "Unaweza kuzungumza kwa utulivu, hata unapohisi wasiwasi.",
  "scriptTeachers34": "Makosa ndiyo njia ambayo kila mtu hujifunza.",
  "scriptTeachers35": "Sasa, kwa upole, legeza ulimi wako na umeze mate taratibu.",
  "scriptTeachers36": "Vuta pumzi moja polepole… na ujiambie kimya: Sauti yangu ina thamani.",
  "scriptTeachers37": "Hisi utulivu huu ukikusanyika hapa. Kuanzia sasa, kabla ya kuuliza swali darasani, au kuzungumza na mwalimu, unaweza kufanya hivi tena… vuta pumzi moja… na utulivu huu huu utarudi, ukiwa na nguvu kidogo zaidi kila mara.",
  "scriptTeachers38": "Sasa achilia.",
  "scriptTeachers39": "Pumzika hapa sasa… hakuna cha kufanya, hakuna pa kwenda… acha tu utulivu utulie ndani, zaidi na zaidi kwa kila pumzi.",
  "scriptTeachers40": "Kabla hatujarudi… Chagua swali moja utakalouliza, au jambo moja utakalosema, wiki hii.",
  "scriptTeachers41": "Jione ukilifanya kwa utulivu.",
  "scriptTeachers42": "Sasa nitahesabu kutoka moja hadi tano. Kwa kila namba utajisikia macho zaidi, makini zaidi… ukirudi na utulivu.",
  "scriptTeachers43": "Moja… ukihisi kilicho chini yako.",
  "scriptTeachers44": "Mbili… sauti za chumba zikirudi.",
  "scriptTeachers45": "Tatu… pumzi ya ndani zaidi, ukichezesha vidole vya mikono na miguu.",
  "scriptTeachers46": "Nne… nguvu zikirudi, safi na zenye umakini.",
  "scriptTeachers47": "Na tano… fungua macho ukiwa tayari… mtulivu, mwenye akili safi na tayari.",
  "scriptTeachers48": "Hongera. Kumbuka: Sauti yangu ina thamani. Niko hapa pamoja nawe.",
